{
  "slug": "longhand",
  "name": "Longhand",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent local memory for Claude Code. Indexes every session JSONL file verbatim\ninto SQLite + ChromaDB for semantic recall across your entire history — ~126ms per\nquery, zero API calls, nothing ever leaves your machine. 17 MCP tools including\nfuzzy `recall`, git-aware `recall_project_status`, and deterministic `replay_file`.\nAlready scored A/A/A on Glama",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `SessionStart` and **1 MCP server**, `longhand`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install longhand@claude-community` from `Wynelson94/longhand`.\n\nPersistent local memory for Claude Code. Every tool call, every file edit, every thinking block from every Claude Code session — stored verbatim on your machine. Searchable, replayable, and recallable by fuzzy natural-language questions. Zero API calls. Zero summaries. Zero decisions made by an AI about what's worth remembering.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
